---
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer site-footer--brand">
  <div class="container site-footer__stack">
    <div class="site-footer__brandline">{SITE_NAME}</div>

    <div class="site-footer__info-grid">
      <section>
        <h3>광교본원</h3>
        <p>경기도 수원시 영통구 대학로 101, 201호</p>
        <p><a href="tel:0312162322">031-216-2322</a></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>망포분원</h3>
        <p>경기도 수원시 영통구 망포로 142, 202호</p>
        <p><a href="tel:07078182322">070-7818-2322</a></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Instagram</h3>
        <p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/book4painter_/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@book4painter_</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__bottom">
      <nav class="site-footer__links" aria-label="푸터 메뉴">
        <a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a>
        <a href="/blog">블로그</a>
        <a href="/contact">문의</a>
      </nav>
      <div>© {year} {SITE_NAME}. 모든 권리 보유.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer--brand {
    background: #fbfaf7;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    color: #42515a;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .site-footer__stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .site-footer__brandline {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #173934;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .site-footer__info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .site-footer__info-grid section {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .site-footer__info-grid h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #132f2b;
  }

  .site-footer__info-grid p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .site-footer__info-grid a,
  .site-footer__links a {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .site-footer__bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .site-footer__info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
